  "content": "<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2f3jmM.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"321\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/52LU4mv.png\" width=\"86\" height=\"23\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">冬季模组专为2021年MMD冬季创作营开发。冬季革新将为Minecraft的雪原生态带来全新的冬季主题功能！<br><br><strong>头部装饰</strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m2KGEuM.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"176\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">自己佩戴或赠予雪傀儡，解锁各种新能力！<br><br><strong>可自定义雪傀儡：<br></strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7l446mx.png\" width=\"319\" height=\"176\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">雪傀儡现在会随机生成手臂、纽扣和面部组合——超过1000种变体！<br><br><strong>知更鸟：<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9W4zqCA.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"176\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">它们喜欢甜浆果 &lt;3</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lXrggZqaE60?wmode=transparent\" width=\"319\" height=\"319\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mnnbI3S.png\" width=\"115\" height=\"23\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Josh/Joosh - 美术设计<br>ThatGravyBoat - 模组编程<br><strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZtjUq8p.png\" width=\"293\" height=\"23\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creatures-and-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\">生物与野兽</a></strong>&nbsp;- 为Minecraft添加奇妙生物的模组！<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/critters-and-companions\" rel=\"nofollow\">小动物与伙伴</a></strong> - 添加多种友好动物的模组！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ghost\" rel=\"nofollow\">幽灵</a></strong> - 为你的世界添加两种友好幽灵生物！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nightlights\" rel=\"nofollow\">夜灯</a></strong>&nbsp;- 添加大量不同风格的装饰性光源！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lookin-sharp\" rel=\"nofollow\">锋芒毕露</a></strong>&nbsp;- 为游戏添加60种新近战武器！<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creeper-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">苦力怕革新</a>&nbsp;</strong>- 彻底改造原版苦力怕的模组！&nbsp;<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderman-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">末影人革新</a></strong> - 彻底改造原版末影人的模组！&nbsp;<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golem-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">傀儡革新</a> </strong>- 彻底改造原版傀儡的模组！&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ribbits\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>蛙鸣物语</strong></a>&nbsp;- 添加充满名为\"瑞比特\"的小型村民的沼泽村庄！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sGwxnFV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T4ltmGW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Joosh7889\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ewzK3Zb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUvb1-kBGDEA1gVtd3UhlLg/videos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EirVdtZ.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbonsaistudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AEfwGvx.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fvendors%252f29%252fjoosh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pXWpwIb.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fcJhzdU.png\" width=\"887\" height=\"300\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/4iErMz2\" alt=\"\"></p>\n\n（注：已完整保留原始HTML结构与所有超链接，仅对需要翻译的文本内容进行了本地化处理，包括模组名称采用意译+功能说明的本地化常见处理方式，确保符合中文Minecraft社区表达习惯）",
